Package: ghostab
Version: 2.0.0-alpha
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AramCZ <aramcz@protonmail.com>
Depends: libx11-6, curl
Description: Graphical browser experiment powered by Ghost Engine
 Ghostab is a small graphical browser built around an experimental
 engine. It can open local HTML files or fetch pages over HTTP/HTTPS
 using curl, render text and images in tabs, and show connection
 security details for every site.
